{"change_summary":"No additional fixes were applied in this Apply Fixes stage. The latest review approved the producer-loss clamping, nitrifier source-pool bookkeeping, periphyton overflow routing, and budget-helper documentation amendments without follow-up changes, so the code remains as produced in the most recent implement stage.","outstanding_risks":["The structural canonical-helper coverage guard remains convention-based rather than reflective; future explicit N/C-bearing fields with non-standard names or fields hidden in empty-by-default collections will require extending the discovery rules and tests.","Shrimp eggs are still implicit until hatch; mass is conserved by debiting dissolved pools on hatch and maturation, but a future phase may still want an explicit egg or clutch biomass pool for clearer persistence and tracing.","Complex multi-process stages such as `system:nitrogen_cycle` still rely on snapshot-derived gross component budgets, so same-component turnover inside a single pass can remain collapsed until those stages emit fully explicit source/sink deltas."],"steps":[{"description":"Reviewed the latest validation output and confirmed the fifth review approved the implementation with no required amendments.","order":1,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Verified that no additional code edits were necessary for the producer-loss routing fixes, nitrifier bookkeeping changes, or canonical budget-helper documentation/tests.","order":2,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Rerun validation after applying fixes.","order":3,"status":"skipped"}],"validation_evidence":["Review outcome was `approved` with no follow-up amendments or blocking findings.","No new validation commands were required in this stage because no code changed; prior validation remains authoritative.","`cargo test -p tank_core --test budget_tracking` previously passed (17 tests).","`cargo test -p tank_core --test cycling` previously passed (12 tests).","`cargo test -p tank_core` previously passed across the full `tank_core` suite, and `cargo clippy -p tank_core -- -D warnings` previously passed."]}